<title>USA: California photographer wins Pulitzer.</title>
<headline>California photographer wins Pulitzer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pulitzer Prize for spot news photography was awarded on Monday to Annie Wells of The Press Democrat of Santa Rosa, California, for her photograph of a firefighter rescuing a teenager from raging floodwaters.</p>
<p>The Pulitzer feature photography prize went to Alexander Zemlianichenko of the Associated Press for his photograph of Russian President Boris Yeltsin dancing at a rock concert during his reelection campaign.</p>
</text>
